*.swp
*.swo

# Node / npm / yarn / pnpm
node_modules/
.npm/
.yarn/cache/
.pnp.*

# Next.js
.next/
# `out/` — Next's static export — is deliberately NOT here. It was, and because a bare
# directory name matches at any depth it also matched `application/port/out/`, the outbound
# side of a ports-and-adapters layout: 39 .java files on disk and in no commit, invisible to
# the wave merge, surfacing a wave later as `cannot find symbol`. It is emitted anchored to
# each app the project declares instead (see app_build_output_patterns), where it is exact.

